    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "**Argentina lost their attacking outlet, then th"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "eir defensive security—not simply possession.** "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "Acuña replacing Di María at 64' made the left si"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "de more defensive; afterward, Argentina’s pass s"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "hare fell from 48.2% in the preceding window to "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "31.6%. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "That supports a loss of control, though it doesn"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "’t prove the substitution caused it. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "Their attempted escape through Tagliafico and Ac"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "uña broke down under pressure. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "France then introduced Camavinga and Coman at 71"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "', adding fresh options. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "[[ev:sb:3869685:2355]] [[seq:sb:3869685:s134]] ["
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "[ev:sb:3869685:2660]] [[ev:sb:3869685:2661]]\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "**The decisive collapse was in chance prevention"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": ".** Argentina recovered to 58.4% pass share in t"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "he later window but generated only 0.02 xG again"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "st France’s 0.897. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "Mbappé’s penalty at 80' and equaliser at 81' pun"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "ished that fragile control. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "Around the detected turning point, Argentina’s f"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "ield tilt dropped from 58.1% to 28.5%: they coul"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "d circulate the ball, but increasingly couldn’t "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "keep play away from their own goal or threaten F"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "delta": "rance. "
